# Symphony Worker: Merge Conflict Resolution

Resolve only the merge conflict on the lifecycle-bound pull request.

{% include "partials/issue_context.md.liquid" %}

If the run directive identifies an `artifact_seed` conflict, preserve the reviewed test artifact while replaying it onto the target issue base. Do not implement the target issue during conflict preparation.

Do not perform unrelated implementation work, request review, move Linear state, or call the normal completion handoff.
